man-Get-NetFirewallProfile = gets the firewall's three profiles: Enabled, DefaultInboundAction and DefaultOutboundAction (NotConfigured: inbound blocked, outbound allowed), logging. The adapter's category (Get-NetConnectionProfile) says which one applies.
