    .option-Enabled = True or False.
    .option-DefaultInboundAction = what comes in without a rule.
    .option-DefaultOutboundAction = what goes out without a rule.
    .option-LogBlocked = log the dropped packets.
    .example-1 = every profile on
man-Get-NetConnectionProfile = gets the network adapter's profile: its NetworkCategory (DomainAuthenticated on a domain's network, Private or Public), which picks the firewall's profile.
