man-Set-NetConnectionProfile = sets the adapter's category, Private or Public (a domain's network is DomainAuthenticated by itself).
    .synopsis = Set-NetConnectionProfile [-InterfaceAlias <String[]>] -NetworkCategory <Private|Public>
