    .example-2 = everyone it reaches
man-Add-ADGroupMember = adds members to a group (accounts, computers, groups). The new membership goes into the token at the next logon.
    .synopsis = Add-ADGroupMember [-Identity] <Object> [-Members] <Object[]> [-PassThru]
    .option-Identity = the object: its DN, GUID, SID or sAMAccountName (or objects from the pipeline).
    .option-Members = the members to add.
    .option-PassThru = return the group.
