man-Remove-ADGroupMember = removes members from a group (it asks first).
    .synopsis = Remove-ADGroupMember [-Identity] <Object> [-Members] <Object[]> [-Confirm]
    .option-Identity = the object: its DN, GUID, SID or sAMAccountName (or objects from the pipeline).
    .option-Members = the members to remove.
    .example-1 = without the question
man-Get-ADPrincipalGroupMembership = gets the groups an account is directly a member of, its primary group (Domain Users) included.
    .synopsis = Get-ADPrincipalGroupMembership [-Identity] <Object>
    .option-Identity = the object: its DN, GUID, SID or sAMAccountName (or objects from the pipeline).
