man-Get-ADDomain = gets the domain: DNSRoot, NetBIOSName, DomainSID, its default containers (UsersContainer, ComputersContainer…), its domain controllers, the GPOs linked to it.
    .synopsis = Get-ADDomain [[-Identity] <Object>]
    .option-Identity = the object: its DN, GUID, SID or sAMAccountName (or objects from the pipeline).
